            "review_title": "Review at Sumo BBQ",
            "review_text": "Lia\n16 contributions\n0\nAverage\nNov 2019 • Friends\nVery cold inside - need a jacket to put on not to shiver. \n\nUnlimited buffet offer includes only one portion of selected items in menu, and only once per table. So, if you are a company of 4+ sitting at one table - either you leave hungry, or need to order more at extra charge.\n\nNo water/hot drinks included. No tissues served, have to purchase them extra - this was beyond our understanding. Meat was not bad, Staff is polite, but no super service as such, would rather call it self-service. \n\nNo value for money - around 450 000 vnd p/person.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 7, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
