            "review_title": "Review at Sumo BBQ",
            "review_text": "MattwalesNorthWales\nChengdu, China2829 contributions\n0\nVery average\nOct 2019 • Couples\nFull of local families with wild children, this is not the place for a quiet dinner. It costs 350000 per person for the buffet so in local terms it is quite expensive. As expected you grill the meat yourself over hot coals at the table. This is pretty common in Asia but for a western traveler there is a degree of novelty, but there are much better examples if you keep looking. Food was OK, the durian ice cream was a bit of an unpleasant surprise as I was expecting the white one to be vanilla. Been here once and probably won't be back.\nRead more\nWritten October 21, 2019",
