            "review_title": "Review at Sumo BBQ",
            "review_text": "MK\nEdmonton, Canada160 contributions\n0\nI had the meat sweats\nDec 2018 • Couples\nOk let’s get one thing straight, it’s a buffet and all you can eat!! So you get coals and cook all you own meat (pork, beef and seafood) right at your table. The beef was good cuts and not super fatty and the pork was the same. \n\nThe seafood was good as well. If you really like an item, well just order a couple more portions up and throw them on the bbq. \n\nThe appetizers (salad bar, mashed potatoes, kimchi, etc) were good as well! \n\nThe service was excellent and quick. \n\nOne thing is, I’d recommend going on an empty stomach!!\nRead more\nWritten December 8, 2018",
